.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt X509_ACERT_GET_ATTR 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm X509_ACERT_get_attr ,
.Nm X509_ACERT_get_attr_by_NID ,
.Nm X509_ACERT_get_attr_by_OBJ ,
.Nm X509_ACERT_get_attr_count
.Nd Retrieve attributes from an X509_ACERT structure
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/x509_acert.h
.Ft X509_ATTRIBUTE *
.Fo X509_ACERT_get_attr
.Fa "const X509_ACERT *x"
.Fa "int loc"
.Fc
.Ft int
.Fo X509_ACERT_get_attr_by_NID
.Fa "const X509_ACERT *x"
.Fa "int nid"
.Fa "int lastpos"
.Fc
.Ft int
.Fo X509_ACERT_get_attr_by_OBJ
.Fa "const X509_ACERT *x"
.Fa "const ASN1_OBJECT *obj"
.Fa "int lastpos"
.Fc
.Ft int
.Fo X509_ACERT_get_attr_count
.Fa "const X509_ACERT *x"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Xr X509_ACERT_get0_attr 3
retrieves the
.Fa loc Ns th
.Vt X509_ATTRIBUTE
from an
.Sy X509_ACERT
.Fa x .
.Fn X509_ACERT_get_attr_count
returns the total number of attributes in the
.Sy X509_ACERT .
.Pp
.Fn X509_ACERT_get_attr_by_NID
and
.Fn X509_ACERT_get_attr_by_OBJ
retrieve the next attribute location matching
.Fa nid
or
.Fa obj
after
.Fa lastpos .
.Fa lastpos
should initially be set to -1. If there are no more entries -1 is
returned.
If
.Fa nid
is invalid (doesn't correspond to a valid OID) then -2 is returned.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Xr X509_ACERT_get0_attr 3
return a
.Vt X509_ATTRIBUTE
from an attribute certificate, or NULL if the specified attribute is not
found.
.Pp
.Fn X509_ACERT_get_attr_by_NID
and
.Fn X509_ACERT_get_attr_by_OBJ
return the location of the next attribute requested or -1 if not found.
.Fn X509_ACERT_get_attr_by_NID
can also return -2 if the supplied NID is invalid.
.Pp
.Fn X509_ACERT_get_attr_count
returns the number of attributes in the given attribute certificate.
.Sh HISTORY
.Xr X509_ACERT_get0_attr 3 ,
.Fn X509_ACERT_get_attr_by_NID ,
.Fn X509_ACERT_get_attr_by_OBJ
and
.Fn X509_ACERT_get_attr_count
were added in OpenSSL 3.4.
